### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/up
Accept: application/json

###

### List All Central Tenants
GET http://localhost:8000/api/central/tenants
Accept: application/json

###

### Create New Tenant (Auto-provisions PostgreSQL Schema & Runs Migrations)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/central/tenants
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "name": "Clinica Santa Monica",
    "slug": "clinica-santa-monica",
    "tax_id": "12345678000199",
    "timezone": "America/Sao_Paulo",
    "settings": {
        "reminder_notice_hours": 24,
        "cancellation_window_hours": 4
    }
}

###

### Get Tenant Details by ID
# @prompt tenantId The UUID of the tenant
GET http://localhost:8000/api/central/tenants/{{tenantId}}
Accept: application/json
